e derives its width from a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]single declared source of truth guarded by a test, and that source [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]declares 100 columns instead of 120 across the sase repo and the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]chezmoi dotfiles repo.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]prettier_width_100.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/prettier_width_100.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-gt[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-gt/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Collapse every prose-width declaration onto one source of [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]truth[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]unify[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]unify: introduce sase.markdown_width as the single width authority plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a package.json prettier config block, rewire all five Python declaration[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sites and both Justfile recipes to derive from them, and add a guard [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test that fails if any site re-forks the number. No width change and no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Markdown reflow in this phase.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Move the declared width from 120 to 100 and reflow the repo[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]flip[dim] · [dim][/dim]after unify[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]flip: change the single width authority and the package.json mirror from[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]120 to 100, reflow every prettier-owned Markdown file, regenerate the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]derived memory shims, agent instruction files, and generated skill [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sources, and update the doc prose that names 120 explicitly.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Move the chezmoi repo and the editor formatter to 100[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]chezmoi[dim] · [dim][/dim]after flip[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi: move the chezmoi repo's own prettier recipes and the nvim [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]conform prettier args from 120 to 100, reflow chezmoi's Markdown, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]redeploy the generated skills so the skills sase writes at 100 pass [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi's own formatting gate.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-gt","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-gt.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9aff1b1326550567cc71e583fbd0ff0a","started_at":"2026-08-07T12:38:36.920034+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1786109511,"sha":"57a045cfc6a7f72308d71d0ec66fb1b39f9af13f","subject":"refactor: narrow the declared prose width from 120 to 100 and reflow"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"48ec3c7defc9d6c554d05e8cc88dc54fe7655f6efb475501c0f5ff5428176afc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gt.2/chat.md","size_bytes":6764},"commits":{"digest":"77654670b1db1eaea149d646b8d0a42900cc4c3f015dede772184fc542ee16b3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gt.2/commits.json","size_bytes":246},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gt.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"65d3849a4bba897a5513ccaee5c82a267a646dee10becbfdbbf642373d3883aa","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gt.2/meta.json","size_bytes":599},"prompt":{"digest":"